                <SHORT_DESCR>
                    <P>The purpose of this notification is to inform the market that RVO is planning to award a contract to Norwegian Geotechnical Institute (NGI). This assignment 'Synthethic CPT Work for Ten Noorden van de Waddeneilanden Wind Farm Zone (TNWWFZ)' has an estimated value of € 113.000,-. For this decision RVO appeals to article 4.16 of the Procurement Act 2012. Through this voluntary prior notice we provide other market parties with the opportunity to disagree with our motivation in the attached document. Please read this document carefully for all the information. Companies which still disagree, can share their elaborated motivation (on why) up to February 25, 2021 (11.59 P.M. CEST), by sending an email to IUCEZteam1@rvo.nl attn. Dick Heemskerk. After this deadline, RVO intends to award the assignment to NGI.</P>
